# Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 (int8) model artifacts - pinned SHA-256 manifest
#
# Purpose: publish this file next to the Daymark-controlled release asset
#   sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-int8.tar.bz2
# so a consumer can verify both the archive and every byte inside it.
#
# Verify:
#   shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS.parakeet                 # checks the archive only
#   tar -xjf sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-int8.tar.bz2
#   shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS.parakeet                 # checks archive + extracted members
#
# Identity notes:
#   * archive bytes 487,170,055; SHA-256 5793d0fd...  (the historical upstream
#     release asset as pinned before upstream replaced it on 2026-11-07)
#   * four model files are the exact bytes pinned in
#     android/kokoro-poc/scripts/fetch-parakeet-assets.sh,
#     artifacts/weather-app/android/parakeet-assets/build.gradle and
#     ParakeetModelAssets.java; MODEL_VERSION stays ...-sha256-1
#   * the replacement upstream archive (487,211,443 bytes, SHA-256
#     1495e91b59d7fc53ddca91f3431758ec99f8fa253fdb0e1e851be0f72b14b0f9)
#     is NOT covered by this manifest and must not be adopted without separate
#     review and on-device re-evaluation.
#
